sentences.text:
The sentence imposed by the learned Third Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Panchmahals at Godhra, vide judgment and order passed in Criminal Case No.1661 of 2002 dated 21.8.2012, which is confirmed by the learned Second Additional Sessions Judge, Panchmahals at Godhra by the judgment and order passed in Criminal Appeal No.28 of 2012 dated 27.1.2017 are hereby suspended and the applicant shall be released on bail on his executing personal bond of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten Thousand only) and one surety of like amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
(a) surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
(b) not leave the State of Gujarat without prior permission of the Trial Court;
(c) furnish the present address of residence to the I.O. and also to the Court at the time of execution of the bond and shall not change the residence without prior permission of this Court;
Direct service is permitted.

